    oa:editorialLabel "Muuhome" ;
    oa:hidden false ;
    oa:note "Spelled Muuhome, against the add-on's \"Muuhhome\". Muuh-controlled, and independent rather than protected: they have their own System of Response and need no terragen protection, which is why this classifies as Xenosophont where H'tat'sa'thoss classifies with the Caretaker Gods." ;
